<title>INDIA: India CMC 96/97 net falls sharply.</title>
<headline>India CMC 96/97 net falls sharply.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's state-run computer maintenance firm CMC Ltd said on Friday its net profit in 1996/97 (April-March) fell sharply to 38.4 million rupees from 126.6 million in 1995/96.  </p>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  38.4   vs    126.6</p>
<p>    Net sales		2,241.8   vs  1,743.1</p>
<p>    Other income		40.2   vs    297.3</p>
<p>    Total expenditure    2,100.7   vs  1,779.9</p>
<p>    Interest costs	    54.0   vs     49.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation		65.8   vs     64.8</p>
<p>    Tax			   23.0   vs     20.0</p>
<p>Paid-up equity</p>
<p>    share capital	    151.5   vs    151.5</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
